\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crunor_s_Finest_2_301714.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"pi-tab-6ac62dae605c7-2\" class=\"wds-tab__content\" id=\"w-pi-tabpanel-6ac62dae605c7-2\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Ground Floor\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"202\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crunor_s_Finest_0_323deb.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Core</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Building</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">403 sqm</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"beds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Max. Beds</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Location</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Venore</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"street\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Street</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Market Street</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Features</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"openwindows\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Windows</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"floors\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Floors</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rooms\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rooms</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">16</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 17, 2002<br/>Christmas Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Buildings <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-house-furnishings\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Furnishings\">Furnishings</span></h3>\n<p>2 Areca Palms, Bamboo Table, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Banana\">Bananas</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Barrel\">Barrels</a>, Big Table (1x3), 3 Big Venorean Tables (1x3, 1x4, 1x5), 44 <a href=\"#/wiki/Blueberry\">Blueberries</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Rose\">Blue Roses</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Box\">Boxes</a>, 4 Brown Barrels, 10 Brown Boxes, 2 Brown Counters, Candelabra, 13 Candles, <a href=\"#/wiki/Casks\">Cask</a>, 6 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cherry\">Cherries</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Chest\">Chests</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Coal%20Basin\">Coal Basin</a>, Counter, 27 <a href=\"#/wiki/Crate\">Crates</a>, 3 Cyan Counters, 2 Drawers, <a href=\"#/wiki/Draw%20Well\">Draw Well</a>, 3 Dustbins, 3 Ficus Benjamina, 6 Flower Bowls, Fountain, Giant Lizard Head, <a href=\"#/wiki/Goat%20Grass\">Goat Grass</a>, 4 God Flowerss, <a href=\"#/wiki/Grapes\">Grapes</a>, 2 Heaven Blossoms, 7 <a href=\"#/wiki/Honey%20Flower\">Honey Flowers</a>, Indoor Plant, Kidney Table, Lizard Statue, 2 Love Flowers, <a href=\"#/wiki/Melon\">Melon</a>, Moon Flower, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Orange\">Oranges</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orange%20Star\">Orange Star</a>, 2 Ornate Carpets, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Ovens</a>, 2 Pears, Potted Flower, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Apple\">Red Apples</a>, 2 Red Roses, 2 Royal Blossoms, <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Bamboo%20Shelf\">Small Bamboo Shelf</a>, 11 Strawberries, Sunflower, Some Sunflowers, 12 Torch Bearers, 5 Troughs, Tulip, 2 Venorean Bookcases, 6 Venorean Chairs, Venorean Drawer, Venorean Stool, Venorean Wardrobe, 3 Water Lilies, Weapon Rack, White Flower, <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a> and a Yellow Rose.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-house-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145804&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_6_f8482d.png\"/>\n<div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n</div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\">\n<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32976,32037,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32976, 32037, 6)</a></div>\n<p>In northern Venore, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32976,32037,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32976, 32037, 6)</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-house-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<dl><dd></dd></dl>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Talesia\">Talesia</a> runs Crunor's Finest which provides plants and produce. <a href=\"#/wiki/Livielle\">Livielle</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rodney\">Rodney</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Rose\">Rose</a> all sells wares. These are the rooms:\n</p>\n<ul><li>ground floor: 30sqm hallway, 2x6sqm latrine, 2x6sqm well room, and a 4x4, two 2x2, 2x7, and 4x7sqm storage rooms (<a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Tile\">Stone</a>, Grey Stone, Brown Tiled floors)</li>\n<li>first floor: 10x15sqm shop floor (Brown Tiled floors)</li>\n<li>second floor: 3x7sqm hallway, 2x4sqm balcony, 3x5sqm kitchen, 5x6sqm garden, 2x3sqm latrine, 5x5sqm office, 4x5sqm bed room (Parquet, Yellow Tiled, Brown Tiled floors and <a href=\"#/wiki/Grass%20%28Tile%29\">Grass</a>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Market_Street_Buildings\">Related Market Street Buildings</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>House of Wealth</li><li>Market Street 1</li><li>Market Street 2</li><li>Market Street 3</li><li>Market Street 4 (Shop)</li><li>Market Street 5 (Shop)</li><li>Market Street 6</li><li>Market Street 7</li><li>Plank and Treasurechest Market</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["opticording-sphere-quest"]}